const ensureUniqueProductSkus=async(product:any,excludeId?:string)=>{const values=[product.sku,...(product.variants||[]).map((variant:any)=>variant.sku)].filter((sku):sku is string=>typeof sku==='string'&&Boolean(sku.trim()));const keys=values.map(sku=>sku.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('en-US'));if(new Set(keys).size!==keys.length)throw Object.assign(new Error('Product SKU and variant SKUs must be unique.'),{status:400});if(!keys.length)return;const patterns=[...new Set(values.map(sku=>sku.trim()))].map(sku=>new RegExp('^'+sku.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\]\\]/g,'\\$&')+'$','i'));const query:any={$or:patterns.flatMap(pattern=>[{sku:pattern},{'variants.sku':pattern}])};if(excludeId)query._id={$ne:excludeId};if(await Product.exists(query))throw Object.assign(new Error('That SKU is already used by another product or variant.'),{status:409})};
